  {
    "slug": "arcana-card-types-and-stat-pools",
    "title": "Arcana card types and stat pools",
    "category": "arcana",
    "summary": "Ten card types, skill and stat pools, seven sets, and regional launch limits.",
    "status": "source-uncertain",
    "sourceUrl": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/11u4wLCG1WfL-xSka2Aze0rI9vYRa7mq3N3Gp1bt0AWY/edit",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "block-0513",
        "sourceIds": ["block-0513"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Arcana "
          },
          {
            "text": "is"
          },
          {
            "text": " simply a card system that gives you Stats and Skill Levels. There are currently 10 different types of Arcana Cards and 7 different sets. If this is confusing, just think of the Cards as Gear in most MMOs - you have different types of Gear pieces like Helmet, Chest, Pants…then you have set bonuses for those gear pieces."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "block-0515",
        "sourceIds": ["block-0515"],
        "kind": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "text": "Arcana Cards offer"
          },
          {
            "text": " Pantheon Stats and up to 4"
          },
          {
            "text": " lines of Stats"
          },
          {
            "text": " or"
          },
          {
            "text": " Skills from a specific pool. Here’s all the Arcana Cards and what each can roll:"
          }
        ]
      },
