          {
            "text": "At this stage there are only 2 Set Effects, both being less value than the Pantheon Stats attached to the cards so we prioritize the Pantheon Stats. Parchment and Compass can be from either set but try to have 2 Primal Vigor (gold color set) to pick up the 2-piece passive. In a perfect world we go the following but it’s not a big deal if your Parchment and Compass are swapped"
